| **uvx Free-Installation** | Free-Installation Deployment | Install and run using `uv tool install` and `uvx` commands. No repo cloning needed. Uses STDIO transport. |
| **Local uv Deployment** | Local Deployment | Clone repo and run using `uv --directory ... run server.py`. Requires local source code. |
| **Local pip Deployment** | Local Deployment | Clone repo and run using `pip install -e .` then execute server. Requires local source code. |
| **Google ADK Agent** | Local/Remote Deployment | Prebuilt agent that can run locally or be deployed to Cloud Run. |

**Notes:**
- No Smithery or Docker deployment options found (none marked [PROHIBITED])
- All options are feasible on Linux

