| Feature | SSH Mode | Cloud API |
|---------|----------|-----------|
| Speed | ⚡ 10-100x faster | Slower |
| Offline | ✅ Yes | ❌ No |
| Subscription | ✅ Not required | ❌ Connect required |
| Raw files | ✅ PDFs, EPUBs | ❌ Not available |
| Setup | Developer mode | One-time code |

📖 **[SSH Setup Guide](docs/ssh-setup.md)**

