## 1.2 Deployment Options Extraction

Based on the README, I've identified the following deployment options:

### Free-installation Deployment (Highest Priority)
| Option | Command | Notes |
|--------|---------|-------|
| **uv tool install** (Recommended) | `uv tool install mcp-skillset` | Fastest method, explicitly recommended |
| pipx install | `pipx install mcp-skillset` | Alternative for CLI tools |
| pip install | `pip install mcp-skillset` | Fallback, not recommended for CLI tools |

### Local Deployment (Third Priority)
| Option | Command | Notes |
|--------|---------|-------|
| From Source | `git clone https://github.com/bobmatnyc/mcp-skillset.git` + `uv sync` | Requires git clone |
| Local Development | `./mcp-skillset-dev` | Run from source without installation |

### Remote Deployment
❌ **Not Available**: No cloud-hosted/SSE/Streamable-HTTP endpoints provided by developers. The MCP server runs locally with stdio transport.

### Prohibited Options
- No Smithery-related options found
- No Docker-related options found

